{"c":[{"name":"20261015T193710Z-dfd12b6e003046d4","text":"Issues: #11 move models under models/ first. #12 then interpolates {version} and {changelog_url} in the Cults boilerplate. Changelog URL uses models/<component>/CHANGELOG.md.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T193821Z-29567ccfd52d7e83","text":"Cults schema lives in https://cults3d.com/graphiql. Unauthenticated POST to /graphql is HTTP 401 Basic. A third-party Discord writeup is not the schema.","type":"note"}]}
